<%#
  Avo's layout loads Avo's assets, not the app's, so a custom tool that needs
  an app Stimulus controller gets a dead page. This override hook adds the
  importmap and the app stylesheet to Avo's <head>.

  The two Stimulus applications coexist: Avo's controllers and the app's have
  no identifiers in common.
%>
<%= stylesheet_link_tag :app, "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
<%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
